    "svc.add.eyebrow":"Additional services","svc.add.title":"Solutions that complete your delivery",
    "svc.a1t":"Warehousing & storage","svc.a1d":"Storage, consolidation and packaging in China and Azerbaijan. We combine several shipments and send them cost-effectively.",
    "svc.a2t":"Cargo insurance","svc.a2d":"Cargo insurance for the duration of transport — we take the risk of damage or loss off your shoulders.",
