    "lp.mc.cta.title":"Get a date and a number for your cargo",
    "lp.mc.cta.sub":"Send us your item list: we will pick the corridor, price the time and the rate, and tell you in advance what will need extra documents. The quote comes within 12 hours and the rate holds for 7 days.",
